export anchor StockCertificateStyle:
    number: 123
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Stock certificate
    idea: The dashboard is an engraved share certificate made out to Mara, with hatched borders and guilloche rosettes, share numbers in corner cartouches, projects as a schedule of holdings, and a gold seal.
    base: light
    palette:
        wall: #ece6d8, the page behind the certificate
        cream: #fbf7ea, certificate paper and cartouches
        vellum: #f6efd9, the edge glow of the paper and fields
        engraverSienna: #7a3b12, borders, the title, rules, the primary button, this week bars and focus
        lightSienna: #c98a5a, dotted rules and the last week hatch, never text
        ink: #2a1c10, body text and figures
        muted: #5d4a36, caps labels, classes and times
        signatureNavy: #22325a, the holder name and signature text
        sealGold: #b08a2e, the embossed seal and the focus halo, decorative
        green: #235c33, On track with a ticked rosette
        amber: #8a4a00, At risk with a diamond
        red: #9c1f1f, Behind with a crossed square and the overdue notice
    type:
        Three stacks. Caps is Trajan Pro, Trajan, Cinzel, Optima, Times New
        Roman, serif, always uppercase with 0.1 to 0.3em tracking. Text is
        Big Caslon, Caslon, Libre Caslon Text, Book Antiqua, Palatino
        Linotype, Georgia, serif. Figures are Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT, Didot,
        Big Caslon, Georgia, serif. Sizes are 56px engraved caps title,
        40px italic Caslon holder name, 40px Didone cartouche figures, 18px
        semibold Caslon project names, 15 to 18px body and 11 to 15px caps
        labels.
    layout:
        A transfer agent strip above the certificate holds a rosette mark
        with the brand in spaced caps, caps nav links divided by small
        floral marks with the current one under a double rule, a pill
        search, a sienna New project button with an inner light line, a
        round bell and the italic user. The certificate has a 16px diagonal
        hatch border, a 2px outer line and a 3px double inner frame, with a
        guilloche rosette in each corner and a large faint rosette
        watermark behind the centre. Four oval cartouches with double rings
        hold the figures, active projects and due this week at the top
        corners, overdue and hours at the lower corners of the opening. In
        the centre sit Team holdings of, the huge sienna title, a ribbon
        reading Certificate of progress, a line drawn rising sun vignette,
        then This certifies that, good morning, Mara Okafor in navy italic
        on a rule, the date line and a ruled red notice reading 4 tasks are
        overdue. Ornamental headings with double rules introduce a Schedule
        of holdings table with shares held, percent with a fine line bar,
        matures and standing, then a Record of dividends chart of round
        topped hatched bars and a Transfer ledger. At the foot two
        signature lines, Mara Okafor as holder and 31 October 2026 as
        dated, flank a scalloped gold seal reading BW. Below 980px the
        cartouches sit two by two under the title.
    spacing: An 8px unit. A 16px hatched border, 28 to 40px inner margin and 30px before each ornamental heading.
    density: Formal and centred. One ceremonial top, then a ruled schedule and two half columns.
    corners: Square certificate. Oval cartouches at a 40px by 24px radius, round topped bars and a round seal.
    borders: A 16px diagonal hatch frame, a 2px outer line, a 3px double inner line, double rules under headings and table heads, and dotted row rules.
    shadows: A soft drop under the certificate and under the seal. Everything else is flat engraving.
    icons:
        Solid standing marks beside caps words, a ticked rosette for On
        track, a diamond with a mark for At risk and a crossed square for
        Behind, plus a clock for overdue. Guilloche rosettes decorate the
        corners and the watermark.
    focus: A 2px sienna outline offset 3px inside a 6px gold halo.
    tone: Ceremonial share language, such as This certifies that, Schedule of holdings, Matures and Transfer ledger.
